
>> motive := Zabodza.
>> opportunity := Zabodza.
Zotuluka lembani: (motive palibe-pa-ziwirizi: opportunity).
Zotuluka lembani: (motive ayi & opportunity ayi).

Zotuluka lembani: (Zoona = Zoona).
Zotuluka lembani: (Zoona ≠ Zoona).
Zotuluka lembani: (Zoona ≠ Zabodza).
Zotuluka lembani: (Zoona = Zabodza).
